      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "Template matching (single scale)\n\n'CV Match Template' finds where the template patch appears in the image and returns the matched crop, a score heatmap, the confidence and the location as JSON. The heatmap is piped through 'CV Color Map' to visualize where the match score is high. To draw the match location on the image, chain bbox into the core 'Draw BBoxes' node. Connect a MASK to template_mask for non-rectangular templates (requires TM_SQDIFF or TM_CCORR_NORMED).\n\nNote: plain matchTemplate only finds the template at its original size - if the size may differ, see workflow 09 (multi-scale).\n\nHere the scene is a supermarket produce shelf and the template is the unique round red sale tag cropped from it, so the best match is unambiguous (score ~1.0 at its original location).\n\n"
      ],
      "color": "#432",
      "bgcolor": "#653"
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
